  {
   "id": "uncertainty",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 0,
   "y": 2090,
   "width": 500,
   "height": 330,
   "color": "2",
   "text": "### Uncertainty<br><br>- Complex trauma exposure is not a diagnosis<br>- The phase comparison is of packages<br>- PTSD biology is not complex PTSD biology"
  },
  {
   "id": "hypothesis",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 560,
   "y": 2090,
   "width": 560,
   "height": 330,
   "color": "6",
   "text": "### Open questions<br><br>- How distinct are the self-organization domains in practice, and how should instruments handle overlap?<br>- How should instruments be harmonised across ICD-11 and DSM-5 for pooled analyses?<br>- Which baseline characteristics predict benefit for which trauma interventions?"
  },
